        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7001-US32D, Modern Design Brushed Stainless Steel 1-1/4 Inch Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 7001 contemporary styled stainless steel floor mounted door stop is easy to install with single center mounting point. It is 1-1/4\" long. Made out of stainless steel it has a brushed (satin) stainless steel finish and a black rubbed bumper. Comes packaged with mounting anchor and screw.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: In other finish colors  <a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-modern-door-stop-omnia-7001\"><b>1-1/4\" Modern Door Stop</b></a> and a taller <a href=\"/products/modern-1-3-4-inch-stainless-steel-door-stop-omnia-7000-us32d\"><b>1-3/4\" Stainless Steel Door Stop</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 7001-US32D Modern Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Rubber Bumper Center: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper: Black</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
